WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.370
- So, wait, there's another
blockbuster coming soon.

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:04.373
Fast and Furious.
- [Michelle] Oh yeah.

00:00:04.373 --> 00:00:06.573
(audience cheering)

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:07.406
Aww.
- Is there anything

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.150
you can say about it?

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.640
- You know, I just watched it

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.400
and I gotta say, you know,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.690
it's almost nostalgic

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:19.860
because we're coming to the
end of like a 23 year journey.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:20.693
- Gosh.
- And

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.700
I gotta say, after watching it, I'm like,

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.790
I still don't understand
how we're able to surpass

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.350
the last one that we did.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.477
'Cause like, after going to
space, I was literally like,

00:00:31.477 --> 00:00:34.830
"what could we possibly do to top this?"

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:35.747
You know what I mean?

00:00:35.747 --> 00:00:37.050
- Yeah.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.610
- I just don't understand.

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:39.810
- Do you think y'all did

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.040
with this one?
- I really do.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.600
- Yeah.
- I really do.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.280
And the beauty of it is,

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.363
in a sense,

00:00:46.654 --> 00:00:49.920
you're gonna be left
like a little incomplete,

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.900
after the movie's over.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.831
You're gonna be like,

00:00:52.831 --> 00:00:53.664
"Wait a minute."
- What?

00:00:53.664 --> 00:00:55.320
- "You can't, no, no, no, no, no,

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.725
movies don't end like this."

00:00:56.725 --> 00:00:58.170
(Michelle laughs)

00:00:58.170 --> 00:00:59.010
That's all I can say.

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:02.640
- [Kelly] Oh my God, that's
the greatest teaser ever.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:03.473
What?

